# Pasadizo 2, the tunnel (C4a, contract 39), 6 x 34, interior. column = i, row = j. The second underground passage: the C3 pieces (concrete slabs, small white tile walls, light posts, floor grates, black void on the
# open sides) with ONE new signature touch: an animated HOLO billboard (the city's advertising reaches under the road). North ladder (2,1), south ladder (2,31), an Ether-less stash: a Prime Salve (1,22), a keeper.
@map pasadizo2
@size 6 34
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill concrete
@spawn north 2 2 S
@spawn south 2 30 N
@legend
  .  tile=concrete
  a  object=twall
  b  door=rope_ladder
  c  tile=void_dark
  d  object=sign text=pasadizo2.sign interact=look
  e  object=light_post
  f  tile=grate
  g  object=holo text=pasadizo2.holo interact=look
  h  npc=guardia id=keeper face=SW text=pasadizo2.keeper
  i  object=holo text=pasadizo2.holo2 interact=look
  j  item=prime_salve
  k  door=rope_ladder
@grid
  aaaaaa
  a.b..c
  a....c
  a..d.c
  a....c
  a....c
  a...ec
  a....c
  a....c
  a..f.c
  a....c
  a....c
  a...ec
  a..f.c
  a....c
  ag...c
  a....c
  a..f.c
  a...ec
  a..h.c
  a....c
  a...ic
  aj...c
  a..f.c
  a...ec
  a....c
  a....c
  a..f.c
  a....c
  a....c
  a...ec
  a.k..c
  a....c
  cccccc
@warp b -> pasadizo2_n spawn=ladder
@warp k -> pasadizo2_s spawn=ladder
